{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45e1695765d3f05eb4bc8d5c282918f8670c96907c811ced6d1685d4a4d239f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:087be41ef921704b6028b7ff2dc06b06aa32de44d0252f207457045c2acff3ed",
      "text": "为了偿还这份罪孽",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67b673c942718daa46d736436f7cfada7e23449d3ebe7b4b39424255a405379c",
      "text": "初中时代，锐心坚信自己才是最正确的而\n付诸行动。然而以某起事件为\n契机，他下定决心要为他人而活。\n看着他这副模样的祖母，\n直到临终前都还在挂念着他，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:087be41ef921704b6028b7ff2dc06b06aa32de44d0252f207457045c2acff3ed",
      "text": "为了偿还这份罪孽",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c28f322a5f6125e2aa7cd4e0c5cfd2aca55b901598f8365e5022090b4c8e6a4",
      "text": "初中·走廊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3865a0586037ee5f1d529d82433c0e5dd4f0d644951bdcfe23e8a9653ac466a3",
      "text": "我说了让你今天之内拿过来的吧？\n为什么没准备好啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e03200675cd71c0be4ba6ea3d1c40f5e430642376d4d5eb06a2e2a22d2daada0",
      "text": "算、算了，快住手吧。\n我到底做错什么了啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8adb2670e4625358be6e39924d45cea57ad8bd1bbb081b724e8c7b8aa1118f11",
      "text": "就是因为你什么都没做我才说的啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f113ab585ebb90b440a5a18666a0f28317dacf794dc1a2c33713108081f98f",
      "text": "喂，那边的。你们在干什么。\n住手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9497469f632f52f9cdf78c0aea93ce82ffe6075e1957b8b993752bb0730457ea",
      "text": "啊，眉见君……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aa97f117260a00735019ad286406162ca4ce05b4e17ae30502c7ceb086c61f9",
      "text": "可恶，是眉见吗。真麻烦……\n局外人别在那高高在上地多管闲事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:161f16302ef4c95f14e83fa212abd63ffbf582d84e42b769034b86329759721c",
      "text": "用嘴说你听不懂吗。……既然如此，\n看来只能让你亲身领教一下了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000075:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28c97173ec2c7c940325a2c0c9864d6fd181afe035168147b99adb0fbefb8428",
      "text": "……那次真是对不起了。\n最后闹到彼此都受伤的地步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:157ea48c7dc9b91d8c8a94f7a7eba3070339f016d4d4f29e632eb6df20084566",
      "text": "没什么大碍，这伤也是我自己不小心。\n彼此都先好好养伤吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aeac54521cf96f73ea86888cf99c90f412c1c21f0ec5a72deea65ac2f741b61",
      "text": "但是，绝不要再做那种行径了。\n……没有下一次了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7adc956eb592b8dcedca1a60246cfcebbe0b59106ecc7a93f146a210271bfd04",
      "text": "我、我知道了。\n真的，对不起了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4baf7dbb0a7af4829a7125d94ebfefe8e71a8703bf370df80313ca89a8d9fee",
      "text": "你们两个！不准再动粗了。\n……特别是眉见君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebd669a653540e438736f222820a9fa8afa744691bad86a24a24192b8912c607",
      "text": "我一直觉得你的正义感非常出色。\n感激你行动的学生也有很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec20134c3cbded1ee1b8f1540bb8f9cd7b6a8e39139c6c2e481495ddc650a26",
      "text": "但是，那个……今后为了尽量\n不让父母担心，你也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:578c20d3e346d9b8cb01f6721849db540400bed22eb114abfc37c770c9fa1dc7",
      "text": "（他这么说着却不和我对视，\n大概这次也是因为对我的所作所为心存感激吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:343dedc94600877149e3ed7e8251d0c7a609bf8d2558678d7a521f6fb5213197",
      "text": "（……没错，我是正确的。无论何时都是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6121ae63987d4b2f87ef68a1aa889186722140c4576d265750d15f25e26a55e3",
      "text": "那么，我先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa429138756d0c3115b35f1344cc63bd9bbfae3616b0d398b8a0b36817986e5",
      "text": "眉见那混蛋。\n总是擅自为所欲为……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f58d88a79e5ae16490f0cb4c515baa8552fec8b66d5564e70781861b386b718a",
      "text": "（……啊啊。是那时候在一起的家伙吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fb608cd1968abac3ea6e9c884610a033e294a2e5fa6473ec65efbef3874567c",
      "text": "（难得给过你机会，\n你却好像根本没有反省啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d5d9db1beeb0d4162521478d8484f40492692cc4f44b624633c3e2c06a25c23",
      "text": "唔……可恶……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee951012cf49d2d528bf75452d99bc40267ed92ec71e44be4cda17a5a7a8382",
      "text": "……逃跑，是因为\n心里有愧吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ad61b907b5917bb154dbe56b5eb05cf11841204247d8f506a6e6a072a6b23f5",
      "text": "（既然明白自己的错误，为什么不纠正？\n就是因为这样，才会一直愚蠢下去）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b211ef3f7018fad188d79a0c79bc182e64a2ec15f81832b37a6348c52d61413",
      "text": "……算了，无所谓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09eb3428159efc027388e9ac2e76d56c12d89ebd23be0fd830bae1eaea020a45",
      "text": "要是再有什么事，由我去教导他便是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8361d45995ad7312c0448637752d350d42e35ae34d2f0983f0eb56ccb8b4eb56",
      "text": "（明天的预习，这样就行了吧。\n……去喝口水吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17fc7e1fef63911d5b86380f265c09cbef064d0ee3638cfb96990b3afd6545d0",
      "text": "（……？客厅里，有人在）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f750b2be49b6e6e82cf923107ff566903b710fd56b5a3248222d777b62f541d4",
      "text": "……、……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93157e12fafcb69b06dfc7936556c3f42d9bc1b77106a3a4a0579a8278de8957",
      "text": "（他们两个，都回来了吗。\n但是，到底在……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e31e834a4d1417ded41199438924a4964a01fff0606acacb6fd42453e1728862",
      "text": "对老师还有受伤的同班同学，\n我们还能怎么道歉才好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bac7d5d391b1d3307d7faa1de2284b8d21ccd9509e7c78f76897b939249a6250",
      "text": "已经够了。大家不是也说了，\n这次也不会把事情闹大吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:040102b7107e6abf5bf903c8658248b1a991812a2c760065fe61e408eeace936",
      "text": "是啊，也是呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e337c10e4560cbd15ca3bbd28fd5df1b83134f04243ac7f383204aba2afbddf9",
      "text": "我希望那孩子，能连同弟弟的那份一起自由地生活。\n所以……、呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36408bb3da65d9ef5f2332ec7205175876f6875e7f0a2401e9377b371a8aff6",
      "text": "别哭。只要有我们在，锐心就没事的。\n好了。把那个收起来，今晚早点休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74bc39f4dbfbdbc813c5252a49d6af6aef0ca2a0fbcdebcbc0d10ad5f20537b2",
      "text": "（弟弟……？在说什么？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92acbae543de85614671c3f57eec564463fe83a4fb4499e2afbe549cda3b7158",
      "text": "我记得，是在这附近……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3d14f41629208cc34af5f054a30d6500a0d165be0c5bcd03027f5699f62f459",
      "text": "（这是……母子健康手册？\n但是，从这里开始就没有记录了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45bcf15a8e648d8c270ba31870f1e7c7f4f70a02612f25723ee927d07f9e77c3",
      "text": "……我……\n有个没能出生的弟弟吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e31e834a4d1417ded41199438924a4964a01fff0606acacb6fd42453e1728862",
      "text": "对老师还有受伤的同班同学，\n我们还能怎么道歉才好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec20134c3cbded1ee1b8f1540bb8f9cd7b6a8e39139c6c2e481495ddc650a26",
      "text": "但是，那个……今后为了尽量\n不让父母担心，你也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b50b6bcc4d93cb88a4ddf2947dcfd4b208d6d1fe6390c26770b7d42c95d8eaac",
      "text": "难得给过你机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bac7d5d391b1d3307d7faa1de2284b8d21ccd9509e7c78f76897b939249a6250",
      "text": "已经够了。大家不是也说了，\n这次也不会把事情闹大吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d5d9db1beeb0d4162521478d8484f40492692cc4f44b624633c3e2c06a25c23",
      "text": "唔……可恶……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a5cce842bbe2edaf385a98779a0e7e1a62a77470fea0c32d407006c0c7600a8",
      "text": "看来只能让你亲身领教一下了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e337c10e4560cbd15ca3bbd28fd5df1b83134f04243ac7f383204aba2afbddf9",
      "text": "我希望那孩子，能连同弟弟的那份一起自由地生活。\n所以……、呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6353eb692012e406342f95259c1472f516c58a0cee6e6f8d38b32de4274e18f",
      "text": "……没错，我是正确的。无论何时都是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:803c4e31c16ab8fa1d92f2de2b2d6946c42739dcbb14b0f1b0e396a787024464",
      "text": "（我至今为止，一直……\n在利用着父母的爱，以及弟弟的死）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1df0cf9dc5d3301f4a4ff2f8ff64a707e97d0a597cacb04bc1bfba9da3b0c4f",
      "text": "……“我无论何时都是正确的”，是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e1571c46d73f70ffbdaf458c6adf4d9a2d30fc0e624ee21a05365080b4ff7f",
      "text": "（不过是周围的人为了让我变成那样，\n而在背地里打点好了一切而已不是吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_d:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36a952fd67284b424e0c6813c8fbbb4db5495b5669ba5ce4d00c0cdad180ce87",
      "text": "……比任何人都错误的，正是我自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4714aacf4824f975d56efbfc7d0270fd80c9b5ce230aaa815618a0f5cc4c044",
      "text": "祖父母的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fd6ccd1779c68c6dccbd72143dfb472844ea2376add3d2f56534bfc295e0e8e",
      "text": "突然要我帮你剪头发。真的可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5ff77ac1eb03d6ad1b4882b9b7923bc398fd99b07b1a5b871dc6bbb8f79dffc",
      "text": "是的。因为这是要做出个了断。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:584ec80b2f2d850c73d16e51cb46b5363744387ff66605c4a20958a31f3c6682",
      "text": "……我知道了，我曾经有个弟弟的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e48fe4d2d08d2f7a5a0afcc19eecb3395bd4c4c5bc036e5bfe115eb2e107e8",
      "text": "是爸爸和妈妈告诉你的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bd40211173b74de6a38661b61d55d6b1609298c29f96b18fe9b8099f83d2748",
      "text": "不是。是偶然听到他们两人谈话得知的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58e488812e1e087525ada98c0a2ec9e3d8c9f9d8b5d2823534e2f98d584264b0",
      "text": "这样啊。……在犹豫该不该告诉你的期间，\n结果还是伤害到你了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5549ad10218b75e31cce5f87edf0620a0f917a283c579f24e69ffc18db5ea7fa",
      "text": "不，这样挺好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d928fbe45ddbe192bdeedcd2a3c0cf45e727b1f9f20ea43ed98fa5b15eefdee0",
      "text": "多亏如此，我终于\n意识到了自己的愚蠢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ca1443e452f8a94807308929be04d79faade1d8c7b34eff240151b65f99e47",
      "text": "今后，我会偿还自己所犯下的过错。\n为了弥补给别人添的麻烦，我会为了大家而活下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b440b86362f6e201179234e5e7dccd7eb78fc2112fd97d922cb05802da1193a",
      "text": "……你总是这么耿直呢。甚至到了笨拙的地步。\n但正因如此才让人担心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:417825758436e91162b878f7ae9e4e5db7674b0298304967f76d1831458d4b7e",
      "text": "锐心，听好。任何人都会犯错。如果不去原谅\n犯错的自己，人生就会变成充满痛苦的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2ff75dd61065dc2b92c6340bd9109074be4ae512c4412e2ea5140ef014f0d00",
      "text": "我希望你能幸福。\n所以，不要那么责怪自……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53d4f550abcf284b5c9f31bdd71588f680a5f156c76eda88c13c3d935d2d514",
      "text": "……请不要再说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d84e7fb402796ab9f6770c446a634a3faf593101dd0d20be8f8569f9323e49a",
      "text": "求求您了。请不要再有任何人……\n来袒护这样的我了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41789a3f975725f965b9e44a78df3c090c2e74399319f3374cc0492972ca458",
      "text": "几年后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:959330ef3df5a32ee1348fb9b176629bcdf63b1f449bab66d1b38eb43b735337",
      "text": "……您身体感觉如何。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01660e9d71e01f41cff63562ea0286a29701365bb9cf5872322b7c8236b387fe",
      "text": "锐心，你来看我了啊。\n比起这个，你在学校怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0b6c467a5a3bdb334bf99537fa22645f23f228bd14a5756f92e75bd3c055cbc",
      "text": "没有问题。无论是在学业还是体育方面，\n在学校里我一直都受到很高的评价。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a52e3ef3ea319a20ab857cb7947abaa3e98dbdefacaed16b820ce3e091f6ec53",
      "text": "身为学生会长，\n为了让大家能度过更好的校园生活……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1e1c2e28da1b4297b5ceccc3cb29fc14a3b20554c9d5f938724ca2b416aad49",
      "text": "……嗯。已经足够了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:190bb5fda553bbb9e70c3b9f3cde61d23b2a2900ecddf4ff9ba91c0df55043fc",
      "text": "从那天起，你就一直，\n只为了大家而活着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f8525cb8e3ce20d3f811f7a36568faca966a417d161b88b34c9bf5297d2944",
      "text": "……是的。在那一天，我脱胎换骨了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dbbd798016b4ea72226ecb9ff36cfdc40110810658b670ebb42adfac63ca63c",
      "text": "将自己的力量，奉献给他人。\n选择符合当下最优解的言行与神情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3461e9bee114b26cb548265ac8e40127f465926f2922d0557ee1a154d00714e4",
      "text": "只要这样约束自己……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cb6b85d9d8c1613e5f3c73e7d818f0aac34c7e47dec37b684c1e1dc95a4cd3a",
      "text": "过去那个愚蠢的我，\n就再也不会犯下任何过错了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:794aae86dea006a860360ec0bb554c2fa247e289753580102a3d178692ed4d3c",
      "text": "……我说，锐心。\n爷爷临终前曾经说过吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21337d370366f33509e82493197ba28919ec245d17e339e1b971e38d399804f1",
      "text": "无论你成为一个犯下怎样错误的孩子，他都深爱着你。\n希望你不要为了别人，而是为了自己活下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e49600a0bb0e7d8c391d81bc17682f774852199dc1c760d51ca392d39686c165",
      "text": "我也求求你。\n差不多该原谅自己了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf30e675a474e3059fecbbd542636b60a7c1af92103707bbe9d9362cc3ed5b25",
      "text": "……为什么在哭呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e161495405afc79ec7cca586cc7351aa22a2bbae360ffb8495bcfd073aa251",
      "text": "……我不知道。已经什么都……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:793f321eea6d74ed0d29fd092a323d4a26ed8b8fda8bdc7c8df70c7f1db87f8d",
      "text": "我连自己的事……都弄不明白了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30e80e811f6b5b505f5a99deb8d24ba7dc1a292a5c75758bce61aac95c0e1317",
      "text": "锐心……\n无论长到多大，在面对自己的时候都很笨拙呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60e20872de502231326a6405a2eccfd237303fbde8ec2f426e0139376db52351",
      "text": "那些眼泪啊，是你的心\n在说“想要获得幸福”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f447f42b0d0765f3101f6e6ee1b9bb366b9478141c09534d74c6bbc9f8c5ad9",
      "text": "……请好好珍惜那份眼泪吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6fe2786e4ae0b3ef5bd6dc26631aa89bfaf805e08e2b2234400a15244f9f51a",
      "text": "……我过一阵子再来看您。请多保重。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:104093dd34df918d6999bde33cef855c76162141c21477d2c38d999e6b88385e",
      "text": "那个，能耽误您一点时间吗？\n有关于您祖母的事情要跟您说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9eb93c59120e94cc1f77bac2249619e19be8f7e07b44c9c9a762ea03c8d137",
      "text": "好的。请问是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:541a204843ad2ff6a8115fde70472160e227e047e4dfd9795cffa26b0a44cc28",
      "text": "虽然时间不长的话，\n还是能正常说上话的状态……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9ee6ba80d2a52c00ad2fb56f6f1f8908de3f81aeb3f4b270549c56b082172ef",
      "text": "但医生带话说，危险的状态还在持续，今晚恐怕会很难熬。\n您打算就这样留下来陪床吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3768e462199c6836ed26bf502e8d822aca391828edc890255ad06a6fd62242d6",
      "text": "嗯，请务必让我留下来。\n……麻烦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f69fab96c65984e0cd2383cf695355fa8adbb94d44ba45f538d75b246621d3a",
      "text": "……、呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60e20872de502231326a6405a2eccfd237303fbde8ec2f426e0139376db52351",
      "text": "那些眼泪啊，是你的心\n在说“想要获得幸福”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f321290f4150727d4e0a94326a723ae869c078719ace77baa38865771f17310a",
      "text": "（……“想要获得幸福”？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e565c53f72082373f3c9daa187352b9df20a71fea593c58e088bf26c497e26f",
      "text": "（在受到如此多的眷顾、肆意妄为之后……\n我居然还在想着那种事吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df3b11196c8c479b66362fffe586fe185b997837b288ff2315835af91cc34170",
      "text": "（我……怎么可能会被允许有那种奢望……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d187c8c0548ac4006a6c573b3c807cc929f680a6ebec11914c218541fd4b09",
      "text": "……就在那一天，祖母与世长辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df5af7a63075c56a87b0dcb2e64e87819b58fab712febba3e0f15055f7d2989",
      "text": "我在两位身上感受到了偶像的才能。\n请务必让我协助两位，将那份光芒传递给世界！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41292d5190924bc6e12402ccea11d6ce40bd79b3f51dc87aa6c11af9a9959cff",
      "text": "（……315 Production。是个听都没听过的\n事务所的发掘。这一次……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5355609b33e3398a7b3327aee84f78f7363e1d25410c0abb6b6e0868ba544548",
      "text": "（……“这一次”？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05f7ee309e22ee8174894861552875b693a1f02345ea17a0a8012d94901b0386",
      "text": "（同样的借口，我以前应该也用过吧。\n我到底打算把决断推迟到什么时候？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e81b17453b399cd643181ed84c312e1bf8fab9d206e7aaad7c7063572e48696f",
      "text": "是时候该做出回答了。\n一周之后，我一定会给你答复。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca1904ed0d15ce88283b9c18f3f936eda19fc7183edfe56b3f5db408826108fe",
      "text": "（……是否进入演艺圈。也就是说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d90f37c75c8ba1ed669ef43d391f8cf33cd347843f37702f21aa786277e69a9a",
      "text": "（在父母与祖父母之间，我该选择哪一方的心愿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e553d23cc1ddbf64cf2700d811d875061d3162c09a6d37d460fcc648359081cc",
      "text": "……虽然从来没有强求过，但父母\n是希望我能进入同一个业界的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e93411e4000315d6123a0dffa4c0c019091acfcd13f1d7c2774200c81be48f6",
      "text": "可是，祖父母……直到临终前，\n都还在叫我要为了自己而活。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35650d17d2f9e3067518132ce98cc958776f2811b06cb03b7e160e0dec28a5af",
      "text": "他们认为演艺圈，如果是“为了某人”的话就不该进入。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000155:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8cebf9b3a67049b617ddd3e9186e5fa6ac9c12715b4aab931cadc44093fcaf4",
      "text": "……征一郎先生。\n有一件事，我想跟您商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a67791356bc2adf6d5d8c7bc0d5c20a97ca0b017c66cac64451796cae00d54d7",
      "text": "这样啊……虽然决定进入演艺圈，\n但你也有着自己的准则是吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25932aa31d9e02cc8f5f35039db23a29809b07e927482d4db1ab3b6b5a3153c",
      "text": "当然了，照你想做的去做就好。\n我们可没有打算强迫你做不情愿的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495e9735816f5da920df8257d2b8398d786006681d97904be7a4fb7fa8cf0d56",
      "text": "话虽如此……说实话，我很高兴哦！\n妈妈也一定会高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e1972c652bafa7954fe41aaaafe2ed97580c7431a1dc1953fd7c7f9926ad759",
      "text": "……那太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae7700f20d76cc5379ef0bbdfad3cbd7870149f2414df9ea5577ab57b8794278",
      "text": "（考虑到我曾经做过的事，\n我不能辜负这份深切的期待。但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d586634bb11da5e4d703aa0d9a7b739f0c31dced22a32c47a2d8c57b27c6f677",
      "text": "（总有一天，我也想回应那两个人的心愿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c71a2d8c7981de5c7b8c58e3c4436c4991adf6cd51ad6900c716a0a96309788",
      "text": "（“为了自己而活”。虽然我很清楚，\n这样的我不应该抱有这种想法……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706e531712be8b4e7ed2bed9a28f77eb6c73a664e089859bda5e677e61528bc8",
      "text": "对了。只要你进入了演艺圈，\n我们一家人的羁绊就变得更加深厚了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3515028faa7da45530c8e5c628699f81aecefd048ce1dee1884f6030b6e6db52",
      "text": "能聊同一份工作的话题聊得很起劲，\n在一起的时间可能也会变多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f11a2fc8efdb853c40d5019e09dc27bd016471bc7aaee4600126bd4ff269d7c4",
      "text": "（……能聊同一份工作的话题聊得很起劲。\n在一起的时间变多……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dfc36d2af9d22ce6b5b73b491f908936f2ea0531991fc58251564a2b3eeb6b0",
      "text": "……说得也是呢。我也一直是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
